license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Unofficial independent implementation of a reconstructed ARC protocol for
  Language Models Need Sleep. Includes transactional memory consolidation,
  bounded JSON dreaming, isolated adaptation, CPU correctness checks, and
  auditable experiment runners. No quantitative paper reproduction is claimed.
keywords:
  - continual learning
  - ARC
  - reproduction
  - language models
